    {
      "path": "style.css",
      "content": ":root {\n  --bg: #1a1a2e;\n  --card: #16213e;\n  --primary: #e94560;\n  --secondary: #0f3460;\n  --text: #eaeaea;\n  --accent: #f5c542;\n  --focus: #f5c542;\n}\n\n* {\n  box-sizing: border-box;\n  margin: 0;\n  padding: 0;\n}\n\nbody {\n  font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif;\n  font-size: 18px;\n  background: var(--bg);\n  color: var(--text);\n  min-height: 100vh;\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: center;\n  padding: 16px;\n}\n\n.metronome-card {\n  background: var(--card);\n  border: 4px solid var(--secondary);\n  border-radius: 12px;\n  padding: 32px 24px;\n  width: 100%;\n  max-width: 400px;\n  box-shadow: 8px 8px 0 rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4);\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  gap: 28px;\n  text-align: center;\n}\n\nh1 {\n  font-size: 1.6rem;\n  letter-spacing: 1px;\n  color: var(--accent);\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n}\n\n.bpm-controls {\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: center;\n  gap: 16px;\n}\n\n.bpm-display {\n  font-size: 2rem;\n  font-weight: bold;\n  min-width: 120px;\n  background: var(--secondary);\n  padding: 8px 12px;\n  border-radius: 8px;\n  border: 3px solid var(--primary);\n}\n\n.unit {\n  font-size: 1rem;\n  color: var(--accent);\n}\n\n.btn {\n  font-family: inherit;\n  font-size: 1.5rem;\n  font-weight: bold;\n  width: 56px;\n  height: 56px;\n  border: none;\n  border-radius: 8px;\n  background: var(--secondary);\n  color: var(--text);\n  cursor: pointer;\n  transition: background 0.15s, transform 0.1s;\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: center;\n  box-shadow: 3px 3px 0 rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);\n}\n\n.btn:hover {\n  background: var(--primary);\n}\n\n.btn:focus-visible {\n  outline: 3px solid var(--focus);\n  outline-offset: 2px;\n}\n\n.btn:active {\n  transform: translate(2px, 2px);\n  box-shadow: 1px 1px 0 rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);\n}\n\n.btn.primary {\n  width: auto;\n  padding: 0 32px;\n  height: 56px;\n  font-size: 1.4rem;\n  background: var(--primary);\n  color: #fff;\n}\n\n.btn.primary:hover {\n  background: #ff5e7a;\n}\n\n.btn.primary:active {\n  background: #c7304a;\n}\n\n.transport {\n  display: flex;\n  justify-content: center;\n}\n\n.beat-section {\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 16px;\n}\n\n.beat-light {\n  width: 80px;\n  height: 80px;\n  border-radius: 50%;\n  background: #333;\n  border: 4px solid var(--secondary);\n  transition: background 0.05s, box-shadow 0.05s;\n}\n\n.beat-light.active {\n  background: var(--accent);\n  box-shadow: 0 0 24px var(--accent), 0 0 48px var(--accent);\n}\n\n.beat-counter {\n  font-size: 1.2rem;\n  background: var(--secondary);\n  padding: 8px 20px;\n  border-radius: 8px;\n  border: 2px solid var(--primary);\n}\n\n#beat-count {\n  font-weight: bold;\n  color: var(--accent);\n}\n\n@media (max-width: 400px) {\n  .metronome-card {\n    padding: 24px 16px;\n    gap: 20px;\n  }\n  .bpm-display {\n    font-size: 1.6rem;\n    min-width: 100px;\n  }\n  .btn {\n    width: 48px;\n    height: 48px;\n    font-size: 1.3rem;\n  }\n  .btn.primary {\n    height: 48px;\n    padding: 0 24px;\n    font-size: 1.2rem;\n  }\n  .beat-light {\n    width: 64px;\n    height: 64px;\n  }\n}",
      "description": "Stylesheet for pixel metronome"
    },
    {
      "path": "script.js",
      "content": "const bpmValue = document.getElementById('bpm-value');\nconst bpmDown = document.getElementById('bpm-down');\nconst bpmUp = document.getElementById('bpm-up');\nconst startStop = document.getElementById('start-stop');\nconst beatLight = document.getElementById('beat-light');\nconst beatCount = document.getElementById('beat-count');\n\nlet bpm = 120;\nlet intervalId = null;\nlet isRunning = false;\nlet beat = 0;\nlet flashTimeout = null;\n\nfunction updateBPMDisplay() {\n  bpmValue.textContent = bpm;\n}\n\nfunction setBPM(newBpm) {\n  bpm = Math.min(200, Math.max(40, newBpm));\n  updateBPMDisplay();\n  if (isRunning) {\n    stopMetronome();\n    startMetronome();\n  }\n}\n\nfunction flashLight() {\n  beatLight.classList.add('active');\n  clearTimeout(flashTimeout);\n  flashTimeout = setTimeout(() => beatLight.classList.remove('active'), 80);\n}\n\nfunction tick() {\n  beat++;\n  beatCount.textContent = beat;\n  flashLight();\n}\n\nfunction startMetronome() {\n  if (isRunning) return;\n  isRunning = true;\n  startStop.textContent = 'Stop';\n  startStop.setAttribute('aria-label', 'Stop metronome');\n  const interval = 60000 / bpm;\n  tick();\n  intervalId = setInterval(tick, interval);\n}\n\nfunction stopMetronome() {\n  if (!isRunning) return;\n  isRunning = false;\n  clearInterval(intervalId);\n  intervalId = null;\n  startStop.textContent = 'Start';\n  startStop.setAttribute('aria-label', 'Start metronome');\n  beatLight.classList.remove('active');\n  clearTimeout(flashTimeout);\n}\n\nbpmDown.addEventListener('click', () => setBPM(bpm - 1));\nbpmUp.addEventListener('click', () => setBPM(bpm + 1));\nstartStop.addEventListener('click', () => {\n  if (isRunning) stopMetronome();\n  else startMetronome();\n});\n\nupdateBPMDisplay();",
      "description": "Metronome logic with improved flash timing"
    },
    {
      "path": "README.md",
      "content": "# Pixel Metronome\n\nA simple offline metronome with a pixel-art aesthetic.\n\n## Features\n\n- BPM adjustable from 40 to 200 using + and − buttons\n- Start and Stop toggle\n- Beat counter that increments on each tick\n- Flashing beat light synchronized with the beat\n- Keyboard accessible controls with visible focus states\n- Responsive layout down to 360px wide\n\n## Usage\n\nOpen `index.html` in any modern browser. No server or internet connection required.\n\n## Controls\n\n- **− / +** buttons: decrease or increase BPM by 1\n- **Start / Stop** button: toggle the metronome\n- All buttons can be focused and activated with the keyboard (Tab, Enter, Space)\n\n## License\n\nMIT",
      "description": "Project documentation"
    }
  ]
}